# What the PeTTa importer writes beside its inputs, as SWI-PeTTa's lib_import
# does: static-import! converts a .metta to a .pl and compiles a .pl to a SWI
# quick-load .qlf next to it, and git-import! clones into ./repos under the
# working directory.  Of the static-import fixtures only the library .pl is a
# source; of repos/ only the local library fixture.
*.qlf
/tests/petta/fixtures/static_import_*.pl
!/tests/petta/fixtures/static_import_library.pl
/repos/*
!/repos/test_metta_lib/
